(text "BUILD CHECKS\n- Measure both motors: common-to-coil resistance/current.\n- Confirm 3.3 V drive margin, ULN loss and temperature.\n- Check boost output current and battery/protection ratings.\n- Set coil sequence in firmware; connector order is provisional.\n- Stop on communication loss. Start with one axis at low speed." (at 15 241 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c8724db2-1ab0-4842-81e4-b9c1127bf410"))
(text "U1/U2: standard 16-pin ULN2003A; not the unidentified 10-pin ULN2002-marked IC.\nMotor A/B denote voltage groups; mechanical pan/tilt mapping is still to be verified.\nConnector footprints are intentionally unset until real modules/harnesses are selected." (at 145 244 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6df43153-38c8-430e-b375-523880ac8da0"))
